                ["Reverb pre-delay", "about 10-40 ms; start near 30 ms and set it by ear", "keeps the word in front of its reverb"],
                ["Reverb decay", "one beat to one bar, then listen (at 120 BPM that is 500-2000 ms)", "the tail should fade before the next phrase"],
